+## 5. Simpan Laporan Sinkronisasi (*Bulk Save*)
+
+**Endpoint API (Super-Universal):** `POST /ppbbr/dokumen/simpan`
+
+**Payload:**
+```json
+{
+   "jenis_dokumen": "laporan",
+   "portal_dokumen_id": 1234,
+   "dokumen_pendukung": "https://url-dokumen.go.id/nota.pdf",
